## Accepted resolved behavior and evidence

Signed e/u option clusters, terminal o consuming a supported option name (including
nounset), retained named/--/positional forms, and nounset OFF by default are in the
resolved profile. Lazy expansion distinguishes missing from present-empty values,
with the documented @/*/array-aggregate/default/alternative exceptions. Functions
and sourced scopes unwind to the same logical execution boundary; subshells,
pipeline stages and command substitutions catch at their own boundary before
existing pipeline/errexit behavior. Existing caller cancellation, public
ShellLimitError, sink and registered-cleanup precedence remain; diagnostic bytes
receive no exemption. This does not broaden the frozen cases into general semantics.

| Independently executed membership | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Author resolved controls, each source-build/installed/moved layout |50/50|
| Independent novel cases, each layout |16/16|
| Selected retained regressions, each layout |151/151|
| Three-layout semantic total |651/651|
| Separate public-consumer type groups |6;18 exact negative diagnostics|
| Separate loaded mutants / restores / binding refusals |3 /3 /2|

The50 author controls cover39 resolved original design IDs plus11 separately named
controls, not all50 original design IDs. Type evidence is not a new nounset public
API/complete AST proof. Loaded controls are not added to651 semantic identities.

## Explicitly unqualified

U06/U07/U17/U27/U28/U31–U36 remain11 OPEN, UNEXECUTED and UNQUALIFIED: arithmetic
nounset, unset-versus-empty aggregate lengths, invalid-option partial mutation and
exact GNU diagnostic/status/line bytes. Fatal status1 remains a provisional
project-policy choice, not an oracle-verified GNU golden. No native Bash/Git oracle
or version execution occurred. No complete strict-mode/full-Bash, general arithmetic,
Node, current HEAD, whole gate, performance, RSS or comparator acceptance follows.

Default80, public registration and runtime dependencies remain unchanged. Historical
public80/Unit1/author failures and the preparation wrong-path HOLD remain immutable;
no original failure is rescored. Inherited module/provider/private-writer/source-only
qualifications remain. Unit1 is an accepted unchanged dependency; its48 selected
redirection controls per layout are part of the151 regressions, not a replay of
all historical Unit1 evidence.

The review observed39 direct children plus coordinator/capture owner (41 runtime
processes;50 known/52 conservative slots including publication),29 fixed internal
loader admissions and0 RegexWorkers. Known hosting processes retired; individual
internal-worker exits remain unobserved, with no global process/native-lifetime
census claim. This docs-only acceptance adds no execution or lifecycle observations.

See `REPORT.md`, `evidence/SUMMARY.json` and the unchanged `evidence/MANIFEST.json`
for original results, captures, source/package bindings and retained-root locators.
The historical manifest binds its original48 members; this later acceptance is
intentionally not retroactively inserted into that frozen evidence manifest.

